Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:05.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（前情回顾）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位就是露比？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is Ruby, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 她可是个魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a demon, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看你不太顺眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't like you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还剩多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long did they give you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}One year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就知晓迪恩和魔鬼做交易的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know about dean's deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.87,0:00:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有莉莉丝是他契约的持有人？- 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That lilith holds the contract? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩两个月时间 迪恩 你不会丢下我去地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got two months left, dean.you're not gonna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是露比 是莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not ruby.it's lilith!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她赶的远远的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent her far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小乖乖们 上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sic him, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第4季第1集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,9月…\N{\fnArial\fs30}September…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,您所拨打的电话无法接通\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have reached a number that has been disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我的 - 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's me. - Who's "me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.85,0:07:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:08:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好玩 你再打来我就毙了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't funny. Call again and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊讶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的 我也不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:08:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼才信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 慢着 慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa!wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的全名是罗伯特 斯蒂文 辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name is robert steven singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成为猎鬼者是因为你太太被魔鬼附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You became a hunter after your wife got possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我情如父子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about the closest thing I have to a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 真的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby…it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.15,0:09:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是变形人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是复仇幽灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're a revenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.49,0:09:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是两者之一 我还会拿银匕首这样做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was either, would I do this with a silver knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要向你证明的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I've been trying to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…it's good to see you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you bust out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来时发现自己置身于一片松海之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}just woke up in a pine bo…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a demon, either, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事小心为妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点都说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That don't make a lick of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你以为在向唱诗班说教吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. yeah, you're preaching to the choir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 四个月前你可是胸口被撕裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, your chest was ribbons, your insides were slop,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,内脏外泻着下葬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'd been buried four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你能逃出地狱回到你的肉身里\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if you could slip out of hell and back into your meats …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 我应该看起来像恐怖MV里的鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I should look like a "thriller" video reject.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得自己成了地狱之犬的磨牙玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember I was a hellhound's chew toy…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后眼前一片昏暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then lights-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在地下6英尺处了 就这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I come to six feet under.that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.29,0:11:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的电话打不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's number's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.19,0:11:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 他不会也\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh … he's not…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.59,0:11:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我所知 他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's alive, as far as I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么叫就你所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. what do you mean …as far as you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几个月没联系他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't talked to him for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑 你就这么让他一个人离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding? you just let him go off by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他铁了心要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was dead set on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.45,0:11:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比你应该照看好他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you should have been looking after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几个月对我或者对他来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}These last months haven't been exactly easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是痛苦难熬的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for him or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不得不亲手埋葬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to bury you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么要土葬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you bury me, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本打算撒了盐一把火烧了你 一贯做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you salted and burned … usual drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆却不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sam wouldn't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴他做了明智的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad he won that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说召唤你回来时你会需要一个躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you'd need a body when he gotou back home somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他就说了这些 - 你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's about all he said. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was quiet…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.75,0:11:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}real quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就这么离开了 再也没回过我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he just took off.wouldn't return my calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着找他 但他却躲着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to find him, but he don't want to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn it, sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我召唤回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he got me home okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是用了黑巫术才办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever he did, it is bad mojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何如此肯定 你该看看坟墓的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you so sure?you should have seen the grave site.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是核爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like a nuke went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有一股力量 感觉是鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there was this …this force, this presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, i don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.49,0:12:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它吹过了我 使破碎的关节都粘合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it … it … it blew past me at a fill-up joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就有这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一个恶魔把我拉了出来或吊了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's like a demon just yanked me out or rode me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,履行他们的契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hold up their end of the bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为萨姆签了份契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think sam made a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我也会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们买过一部手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a, uh, cellphone account with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, lost my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能否为我开下GPS定位系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering if you could turn the gps on for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字是温迪·安特列斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. the name's "wedge antilles."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,社保号是2474\N{\fnArial\fs30}Social is 2474.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他用了这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know he'd use that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:12:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好比他肚子里的蛔虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me? what don't I know about that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.79,0:13:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿怎么成酒吧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal with the liquor store, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友出城了还是其他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents out of town or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我刚说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的几个月是多么的痛苦难熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last few months ain't been all that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.39,0:13:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆在伊利诺斯州的庞蒂亚克城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's in pontiac, illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,离你被埋的地方很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}right near where you were planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我现世的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}right where I popped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.69,0:13:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得真是巧合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a coincidence, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,要两个人来送的披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pizza that takes two guys to deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们走错房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got the wrong room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ya, sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别搞得你没做过似的 我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you didn't do this!do what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他 是他 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.it's him, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经验证过了 的确是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been through this already.it's really him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看上去像幻觉是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look fantastic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩在搞基？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you two, like…together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.45,0:15:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.85,0:15:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}got it…i-i guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.85,0:15:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, i should probably go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.19,0:15:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 这不失为一个好主意 失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. that's probably a good idea. sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 当然会的 凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.surehing, kathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,克利斯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}christie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.72,0:15:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我复活我的代价是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, what'd it cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.99,0:15:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不好笑 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not funny, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.89,0:15:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bring me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,代价是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd it cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖你的灵魂还是更糟的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it just your soul, or was it something worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为我和恶魔签了契约 - 我们都是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think I made a deal? - That's exactly what we think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:15:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这样你满意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解脱了 你却被控制了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm off the hook, and you're on, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是鬼迷心窍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're some demon's bitch boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.35,0:16:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意这样被你救活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to be saved like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我本打算能这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, dean, i wish I had done it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事绝对不会这么结束的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no other way that this could have gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.09,0:16:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在告诉我真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}now tell the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试遍了救你的路子 这就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried everything. that's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图敲开地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried opening the devil's gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试图去交易 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, i tried to bargain, dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没一个恶魔愿意交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no demon would deal, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在地狱里煎熬了好几个月 好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were rotting in hell for months … for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却阻止不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I couldn't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾不是我救你的 行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm sorry it wasn't me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用道歉 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to apologize. I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别高兴太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴萨姆的灵魂还完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gladdened that sam's soul remains intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但更恐怖的问题出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that does raise a sticky question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你救我出来 那到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he didn't pull me out, then what did?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你挖我出坟墓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you doing around here…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么在这一带转悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you weren't digging me out of my grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知道自己不能救你以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, once I figured out I couldn't save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就开始抓捕莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}um…i started hunting down lilith,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能作些补偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to get some payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己去抓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁 你老爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think you are, your old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 抱歉 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sorry, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该先打给你 我搞砸了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i should have called. I was pretty messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我很能体会你的心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. I really feel your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我正在找离开田纳西州的魔鬼们\N{\fnArial\fs30}anyways, uh, i was checking these demons out of tennessee,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走得很急 都事先到这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and out of nowhere they took a hard left, booked up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候 - 昨天早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - Yesterday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I busted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这些鬼怪是因为你才来这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think these demons are here cause of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些烂鬼把我拖出坟墓 现在又来这一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some badass demon drags me out, and now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有某种联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be connected somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.13,0:18:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的意思是 你觉得你还象自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, i mean, do you feel like yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有奇怪的事吗 不同的事 - 有魔力了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything strange or different? - Or demonic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我得象你证明多少次 我就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, how many times do I have to prove I'm me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 没有哪个魔鬼会对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, listen … no demon's letting you loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大发慈悲之心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the goodness of their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们早就做好了肮脏的计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got to have something nasty planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.56,0:18:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得很好 - 好了 我们不知道他们计划了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- well, I feel fine. - Okay, look, we don't know what they're planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.73,0:18:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一堆问题没法解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a pile of questions and no shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,得寻求帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识位通灵师 离这里几个小时车程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a psychic a few hours from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,象这样大的事情 她应该多少有点消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something this big, maybe she's heard the other side talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 值得一试 我快去快回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah. it's worth a shot. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得拿回这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably want this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 那里怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dean, what was it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里 地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我两眼一抹黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. i-i-i-i must have blacked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都记不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在州际公路边 离这里大概四小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's about four hours down the interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.53,0:19:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定你很想开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you'll want to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetheart, did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 那是ipod的固定插座\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is that? - That's an ipod jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该好好照顾我的车 别给她打孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to take care of her, not douche her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我本以为这车归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, i thought it was my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你玩真的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}There still one thing that's bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.53,0:20:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我咬了 或者是被咬的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. the night that I bit it … or got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么逃出来的 我以为莉莉丝会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you make it out? I thought lilith was gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是想的 可是她没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she tried. she couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有 是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean she couldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她点火了 就在我面前想烧死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She fired this, like, burning light at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我一道疤都没留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and… it didn't leave a scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好象我是免疫的 或者别的什么原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I was immune or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,免疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immune?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们谁更惊讶 她还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who was more surprised … her or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后她跑得无影无踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left pretty fast after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:20:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比呢 她到哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about ruby? where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了 下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead or in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你飘忽不定的超能力又有反映了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you been using your, uh, freaky e.s.p. stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 现在你得到了免疫性\N{\fnArial\fs30}ah, well, i mean, now that you got immunity …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管这到底是什么 我只是想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the hell that is … just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会发生哪些古怪的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What other kind of weirdo crap you got going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不让我在这条路上继续走下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, you didn't want me to go down that road,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就没有继续走下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I didn't go down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不是你的临终遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was practically your dying wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们都一起保留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, let's keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太迷人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a sight for sore eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这俩男孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are these the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.70,0:21:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩 这是帕梅拉·巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, dean … pamela barnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个州里最好的通灵师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best damn psychic in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.13,0:22:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.56,0:22:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,才下火山 又进油锅啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the fire and back in the frying pan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个独一无二的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you a rare individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有听到什么风声？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通过一打灵魂来进行占卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i ouija-ed my way through a dozen spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没一个知道谁救了迪恩并且为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one seems to know who broke your boy out or why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.43,0:22:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下一步干嘛？- 问的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what's next? - As nice, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看谁动了这契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can see who did the deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.53,0:22:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是想在这儿召唤恶魔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna summon the damn thing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.10,0:22:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想偷看一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to get a sneak peek at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像没有水晶的水晶球\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a crystal ball without the crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's jesse?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it wasn't forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:22:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.66,0:23:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有机会了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be your gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 听起来真爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'm so in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.03,0:23:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她会缠着你度过余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she's gonna eat you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.10,0:23:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不过我会逃离这一切的 等着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, i just got out of jail.bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.53,0:23:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're invited, too, grumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你别搅合\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相牵着手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take each other's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将接触一个神秘怪物也接触过的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need to touch something our mystery monster touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.96,0:23:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别在这儿碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! well, he didn't touch me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.46,0:23:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.13,0:23:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤并命令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invoke, conjure and command you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}appear unto me before this circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.83,0:24:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤并命令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invoke, conjure, and command you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.46,0:24:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}appear unto me before this circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤并命令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invoke, conjure, and command you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.16,0:24:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}appear unto me before this circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invoke…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.93,0:24:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}castiello?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.73,0:24:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 对不起 卡西迪奥 我并不感到恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}no. sorry, castiello, i don't scare easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥？-是个人名\N{\fnArial\fs30}castiello? its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在我耳边警告我别管这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's whispering to me, warning me to turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.03,0:24:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤并命令你显出你的真面目吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I conjure and command you show me your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.90,0:24:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤并命令你显出你的真面目吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I conjure and command you show me your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤并命令你显出你的真面目吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I conjure and command you show me your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤并命令你 - 也许我们该停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I conjure and command you. maybe we should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.46,0:24:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.70,0:24:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你显出你的真面目吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I command you show me your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.10,0:24:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me your face now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.50,0:25:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.36,0:25:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd bobby say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.90,0:25:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅出重症监护室了 病情稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, pam's stable and out of icu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.60,0:25:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们她失明了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and blind 'cause of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.56,0:25:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们还是没有任何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we still have no clue what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.50,0:25:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还不是完整的事实？-不\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not entirely true.no?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道那个叫卡西迪奥的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a name castiello or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.10,0:25:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着巨大的身形 我们可以召唤它 让他告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the right mumbo jumbo we could summon him, bring him right to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.60,0:25:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy.absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.20,0:25:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是在它干了些什么之后 我们会干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll work him over.i mean, after what he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅就偷看了一眼 她的眼睛就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pam took a peek at him and her eyes burned out of her skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.96,0:25:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想和他面对面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want to have a face-to-face?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.76,0:25:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有好注意了？-目前看 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better idea?yeah, as a matter of fact, i do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.03,0:25:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着一些恶魔来到镇里了 - 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed some demons to town, right?okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.86,0:25:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we go find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.03,0:25:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们肯定知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got to know something about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.30,0:25:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等小费么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You angling for a tip?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我觉得你们是在找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I thought you were looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.73,0:26:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.43,0:26:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地狱兜了一圈回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hell and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.06,0:26:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是太走运了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}aren't you a lucky duck?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.23,0:26:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.20,0:26:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得已经摆脱困境了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you get to just stroll out of the pit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.73,0:26:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 是什么让你如此特别？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, what makes you so special?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.36,0:26:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是因为我长的太帅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to think it's because of my perky nipples.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.56,0:26:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.96,0:26:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我干的 也不知道是谁帮了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't my doing.i don't know who pulled me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.33,0:26:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}right.you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.20,0:26:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, i don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.63,0:26:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒谎是罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}lying's a sin, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.30,0:26:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我很乐意查明真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd like to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.10,0:26:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不乐意开导我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you wouldn't mind enlightening me, flo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.26,0:26:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你的口气 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your tone with me, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.23,0:27:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以亲自把你送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drag you back to hell myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.93,0:27:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.70,0:27:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会？-不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no?no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.36,0:27:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你会你早就下手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause if you were, you'd have done it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.66,0:27:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况是你也不知道谁救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact is, you don't know who cut me loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.80,0:27:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有看来你们也在查这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're just as spooked as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.43,0:27:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在寻找答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're looking for answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.93,0:27:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是超能力的鬼魂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe it was some turbocharged spirit, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.60,0:27:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, uh, godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.16,0:27:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是什么终极魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or some big, bad boss demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.33,0:27:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我猜应该很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm guessing at your pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.86,0:27:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they don't tell you squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.23,0:27:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管它是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause whoever it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.03,0:27:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我离开那里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want me out…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.33,0:27:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定强过你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're a lot stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.00,0:27:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 把我送回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, go ahead.send me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.50,0:27:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别爬着来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't come crawling to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.96,0:27:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会用灭火水龙头和凡士林照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they show up on your front doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.96,0:27:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你跨入门的一霎那\N{\fnArial\fs30}With some vaseline and a fire hose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.66,0:27:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会割断你的喉咙 再把你的肺拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna reach down your throat and rip out your lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.46,0:28:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's go, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.20,0:28:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,派的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.06,0:28:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的好险啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.70,0:28:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点没能从里面逃出来 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not just gonna leave them in there, are we, dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.63,0:28:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 他们有三个 可能更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah. there's three of them, probably more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.50,0:28:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有两个人加一把匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only got one knife between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.90,0:28:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近我已经干掉很多恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been killing a lot more demons than that lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.73,0:28:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了 你高明的兄弟回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not anymore. the smarter brother's back in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.33,0:28:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们得干掉它们 它们很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we got to take them. they are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.70,0:28:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们也很害怕 好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're scared, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.03,0:28:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在害怕把我从里面拉出来的那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scared of whatever had the juice to yank me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.50,0:29:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在处理一个大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with a bad mofo here. one job at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.36,0:31:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是脑子里还有些教堂的钟响\N{\fnArial\fs30}aside from the church bells ringing in my head…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.10,0:31:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.10,0:31:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干吗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.20,0:31:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡不着 想吃汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't sleep. went to get a burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在我的车里 - 习惯了 抱歉 你干吗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In my car? force of habit, sorry. - What are you doing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.93,0:31:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比回来了 我们去喝一杯啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, bobby's back. we're going to grab a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.86,0:31:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 把我那份也喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right. well, uh, spill some for me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.96,0:31:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 待会我找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done. yeah, I'll catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.33,0:31:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell didn't you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.63,0:31:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他要阻止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause he'd just try to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.10,0:31:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止什么 召唤那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}from what? summoning this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.36,0:31:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是正面争锋相对的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time we face it head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.93,0:31:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是来真的吧 - 怎么不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't be serious. - As a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.60,0:31:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是时候呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's high noon, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:31:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不知道它是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.73,0:32:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是恶魔 也可能是任何什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it could be a demon. it could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.56,0:32:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们要做好一切的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we got to be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.93,0:32:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有把一流的魔法匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the big-time magic knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.16,0:32:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你车厢里根本就有个军火库\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got an arsenal in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个主意可不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.00,0:32:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重同意 不过我们还有什么其它选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't agree more, but what other choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以选择生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could choose life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.23,0:32:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 不管这个是什么 不管它想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, whatever this is, whatever it wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.00,0:32:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是冲我来的 我们都知道这个 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's after me … that much we know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.03,0:32:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本就无处躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i got no place to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.76,0:32:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要么被它干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can either get caught with my pants down again,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.53,0:32:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么是我们干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we can make our stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.03,0:32:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 萨姆这次可以帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we could use sam for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.46,0:32:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那会比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}nah, he's better off where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.46,0:33:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂在一英里远我都能闻到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could still smell your soul a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.20,0:33:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来过 你看到了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was here? you saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.03,0:33:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.36,0:33:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.13,0:33:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.76,0:34:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死了 我们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead. we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.66,0:34:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.06,0:34:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.33,0:34:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}funny…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.80,0:34:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正准备跟你说同样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna say the same thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.83,0:35:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.60,0:35:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的漂亮嘛 萨姆 你总是越来越棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting pretty slick there, sam. better all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.76,0:35:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是什么鬼东西 露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on around here, ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.73,0:35:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.13,0:35:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在想可能是某些高等级的恶魔离开了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were thinking some high-level demon pulled dean out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.06,0:35:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.40,0:35:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 人类的灵魂不会直接就离开地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, human souls don't just walk out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.06,0:35:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后轻易的就进入他们的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and back into their bodies easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.16,0:35:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙滴血 大地也颤抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy bleeds, the ground quakes …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.23,0:35:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cosmic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.26,0:35:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有恶魔可以撼动这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}no demon can swing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.00,0:35:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}not lilith…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}not anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.16,0:35:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what can?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.60,0:35:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没见过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing I've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.03,0:36:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是一件艺术品啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a hell of an art project you got going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.23,0:36:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷阱和护身符是世界通用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traps and talismans from every faith on the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.26,0:36:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得怎样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.23,0:36:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,木桩 铁器 银器 圣盐 匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stakes, iron, silver, salt, a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.13,0:36:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我们差不多准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're pretty much set.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.43,0:36:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以对付以往见过的任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}To catch and kill anything I've ever heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.63,0:36:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这依旧不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is still a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.70,0:36:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 以前你从没说过这种话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, bobby, i heard you the first 10 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.56,0:36:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就开始吧 怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we ring the dinner bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.03,0:36:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,您还真是金口难开\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, million-dollar question …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.80,0:36:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算把我们做的事情告诉你哥哥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell dean about what we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.70,0:36:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 只是在寻找合适的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, i just got to figure out the right way to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.10,0:36:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是需要点时间 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, i just need time, okay? that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.26,0:36:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 他会发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, he's gonna find out,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.45,0:36:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不亲自告诉他 他会被气死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if it's not from you, he's gonna be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.66,0:37:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 他都会被气死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's gonna be pissed anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.30,0:37:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于通灵 他一向顽固\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so hardheaded about this psychic stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.26,0:37:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候他一定会阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll just try and stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.56,0:37:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是先暂时低调一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, maybe I'll just take a step back for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.23,0:37:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.56,0:37:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我不是很喜欢你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm not exactly in your brother's fan club,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.03,0:37:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他是你兄弟 我不想插手你们的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is your brother, and I'm not gonna come between you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.50,0:37:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}ruby, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.70,0:37:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我这样做是否正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if what I'm doing is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.76,0:37:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至都不知道 是不是信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, i don't even know if I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.80,0:37:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢直言相告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.80,0:37:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道自己在救助大众\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do know is I'm saving people…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.30,0:37:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,和阻止魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stopping demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.53,0:37:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.90,0:37:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.33,0:37:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定仪式没出错？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you did the ritual right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.56,0:37:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.46,0:37:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touchy, touchy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.66,0:38:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,往好处想 这说不定只是阵风而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wishful thinking, but maybe it's just the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.10,0:38:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.13,0:38:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那个紧紧抓着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who gripped you tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.16,0:38:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你离开地狱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and raised you from perdition.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.13,0:38:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.46,0:39:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谈谈 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.20,0:39:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.01,0:39:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.95,0:39:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.41,0:39:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}castiello.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.81,0:39:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜也是 我的意思是 你是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, i figured that much. I mean what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.35,0:39:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是侍奉主的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.95,0:40:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.81,0:40:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.05,0:40:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的症结所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your problem, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.81,0:40:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.41,0:40:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你是天使吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some angel you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.88,0:40:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那可怜女人的眼睛烧伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burned out that poor woman's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.21,0:40:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过她不要尝试窥探我的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned her not to spy on my true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.38,0:40:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对人类来说 他们无法承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be overwhelming to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.38,0:40:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也无法承受我的真实声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so can my real voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.10,0:40:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你体验过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.51,0:40:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在加油站和汽车旅馆里面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the gas station and the motel?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.75,0:40:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你在说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.88,0:40:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 下次要降低音调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, next time, lower the volume.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.45,0:40:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.18,0:40:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人 特别的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certain people, special people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.51,0:41:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,能感知到我的面容\N{\fnArial\fs30}can perceive my true visage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.48,0:41:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you would be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.28,0:41:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.61,0:41:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在的容貌是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what visage are you in now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.01,0:41:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是 圣职税务会计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … holy tax accountant?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.98,0:41:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个？是具皮囊而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}This? this is…a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.95,0:41:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你占据了某个混蛋的身体？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're possessing some poor bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.05,0:41:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个虔诚的信徒 这是他祈求而来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a devout man. he actually prayed for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.01,0:41:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我可不吃你这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, pal, I'm not buying what you're selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.68,0:41:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who are you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.75,0:41:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经告知你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.35,0:41:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.88,0:41:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么一个天使要救我出地狱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why would an angel rescue me from hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.38,0:41:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运会降临的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}good things do happen, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.45,0:41:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没降临到我的头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}not in my experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.08,0:41:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.31,0:41:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不认为自己应当被救赎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think you deserve to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.51,0:41:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.01,0:41:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是天主下的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because god commanded it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.88,0:42:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们有任务交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we have work for you.
